Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighting is over, and the big hole in\Nthe protective wall is plugged for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finished off the monsters that invaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're working around the\Nclock to fully repair the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once that's done, the Clearflow Lake\NStratum Village should be safe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your work, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's the transfer circle stuff going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I pretty much got it figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's not fully\Noperational, it's almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to send a few people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a delicious-looking treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I had one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't happen to know where\NDirector Bear is at the moment, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:01:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still the sunken area near the\Nwall, and we'll need to deal with it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the spot where Boxo turned\Nbuilding size and dropped in from above?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the hole I made is interfering\Nwith the reconstruction efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. That shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.18,0:01:19.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.27,0:01:33.23,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.06,0:02:53.94,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,450)\fscx66\pos(384.2,54.4)}The Clergyman and the Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This morning's rubble\Nremoval duty took forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done over here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's hardly any air circulation\Nin the transfer chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I work in that oven much\Nlonger, I'll shrivel up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need something nice and refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, give me a cold one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, where are you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hilary, let's get in, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water's nice and refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suori, why aren't you getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really in the\Nmood to swim right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do that for?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.86,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H133C8C&\3c&HCED9B9&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making a temporary pool\Nturned out to be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went over better than ever expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was decided we'd hold a summer\Nfestival to give the villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hunters a chance to let\Nloose after all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our resources are limited,\Nso the party is small.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought everybody could\Nuse a bit of a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sort of thing is the reason\Nwhy Director Bear is in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, ice cream, please. Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice cream, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:05:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but at a summer festival, it's\Ngotta be this. Let's go! Form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.82,0:05:04.03,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HBDC7B5&\3c&H798260&\shad0}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaved ice machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.07,0:05:06.53,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HBDC7B5&\3c&H798260&\shad0}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what is this, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some sort of new product?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.53,0:05:07.78,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H96A7AB&\3c&H293D40&\shad0\frz-15\fax0.3\bord4\fs40\pos(300,123)}Press
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Click!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.78,0:05:17.04,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H3040DE&\3c&HCED9B9&\bord4\shad0\fs30\an8)}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Objectively speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the quality of the ice the vending\Nmachine outputs isn't great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, this is where\Nmy skills come into play!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shave the ice so\Nit's like powdery snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll add lots of\Nfresh syrup on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shaved ice has a distinctive look\Nthat just makes you want to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really cold and sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shaved ice is so fluffy and it melts\Nin your mouth as soon as you eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only wish that I had access to\Nmore than three kinds of syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, some apple slices from\Nan apple vending machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.40,sign_Verdana,text (white; both bags),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE9FEFF&\3c&H67777D&\shad0}Apples, pre-sliced\N Fresh apples you can buy\Nfrom a vending machine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apples and other fruits can be used\Nas toppings for the shaved ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that, it's been leveled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, what are you selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of sweet snack\Nwith fruit and ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks really tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Hunters' Association is picking up\Nthe tab for all the food and drink today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can enjoy as much as you want.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.68,0:06:17.94,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HBDC7B5&\3c&H798260&\shad0\fs10\pos(310,25)}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of magic item\Nwould Boxxo be classified as?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's a weapon or armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to say, he'd be an\Nall-purpose goods-supplying magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about calling him an\Nall-purpose magic item?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.94,0:06:30.70,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H133C8C&\3c&HCACDCA&\bord4\shad0\fs30\fad(500,1)}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you're a vending machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to say vending\Nmachine, but that's what came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it'll have to do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that guy you captured\Nwho destroyed my village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, Director Bear told me that\Nhe gave him the punishment he deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:07:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I don't feel like\NI have a purpose anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason she became\Na hunter in the first
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place was to get stronger\Nso she could get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I even say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me, reduced to a\Nsimple vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's certainly not ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I treasure the time I've spent\Nwith Lammis and everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't trade it for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll stay by my side until\Nthe very end, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more moping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, there are still plenty\Nof things left for us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Hulemy and Shimelai got\Nthe transfer circle working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but it's not fully functional yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of limited to the\Ndungeon and only goes to one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, we can only transfer\Nabout three people at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After much thought, we've decided\Nwhere that transfer point should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within the Origin Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason we ended up choosing\Nthe Origin Stratum is because
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the only one that leads\Ndirectly out of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would make evacuating residents\Nmuch easier in case of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the three people we'll be sending\Nover, I'd like for you to go, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll need to be there in order to link\Nit back to the Transfer Circle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like Lamas and Boxo to go as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skills will come in handy,\Nespecially Boxo's ability to make food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be invaluable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to check in on the\Norphanage and the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in, Boxxo? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I can help, I'm more\Nthan happy to come along. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since Boxo doesn't count\Ntoward the transfer limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should be able to fit one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll accompany them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:08:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Mishuel. You're volunteering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still only able to\Nspeak to you, Master Boxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and maybe a little bit\Nto Lammy and Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would I do if you all left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for placing\Nthis heavy burden on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, off we go!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.00,0:09:32.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(497,178)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.00,0:09:35.47,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx95\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(1,438)}The Origin Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These footprints were made\Nby humans, not monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the circle wouldn't open, they\Nmust have turned around and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stab anything you can\Nreach with those spears!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't line up with those\Narrows either, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you start to get tired,\Nrotate out! On your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roaring strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:09:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yike! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not that bad. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might actually get\Nsomewhere with today's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't say no to some help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, you guys are a sight for\Nsore eyes! Hey, you lot! Come over!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.84,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(195,20)\fad(500,1)}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food's here!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.97,0:10:17.84,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HE7F4FC&\3c&H373968&\fs20}Oden\N{\c&H9BCAFF&} Kokuuma\N{\c&H80898E&\3c&HC62029&} Lightly Salted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cold! So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been days since we had\Nsomething decent to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll eat through everything in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll worry about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll just focus on\Nmaking sure everybody's fed.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.36,0:10:36.36,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're seriously a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were nearly done for back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to start pulling out some\Nworst-case scenario contingencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I think I'd rather not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough,\NBoxo. You're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stairs to the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we having a conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you finally learned how to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll have to\Nupdate you on Boxo later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this stratum have a stairway\Nthat connects to the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you leave the\Ndungeon if things were this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The huge door in front of the stairway\Nwas shut tight and wouldn't budge an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only choice was to dig our heels in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here and try to hold\Nout as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.91,0:11:29.87,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs38\pos(318,295)\fad(1,432)}Shui
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me vote!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Shui!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.80,0:11:42.26,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs35\pos(318,211)\fad(1,351)}Filmina
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly anyone in the Origin\NStratum has experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even against just those green\Nfiends, we had a lot of casualties.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.18,0:11:49.60,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs13\pos(423,260)\fad(442,434)}Shiro
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might have been in real trouble if\Nwe showed up even a little bit later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Akka?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.98,0:11:54.40,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs15\fad(442,434)\pos(75,260)}Aka
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.99,0:11:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right, Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we were nearly out of provisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we might have been in real\Ntrouble if Boxxo hadn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should slow down, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.48,0:12:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, plus it's bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't thank you enough\Nfor everything you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy that everybody's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say that when the school director\Ncame back through the transfer circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she single-handedly\Ndrove off all the nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monsters all right then once Hulemy does
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her thing and gets the\Ntransfer circle working
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again we can evacuate\Neverybody to the clear
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flow lake stratum sure\Nthing leave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.18,0:12:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, feels good to\Nfinally eat my fill. This.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,box will hear of a hero\Nso then what should we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do while hula me's\Nworking oh yeah about that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Director Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The magic item known as Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe you a debt of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept my sincerest thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transfer circle is in your\Nhands, magic item engineer Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, heed my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unwise for us to stay\Nin this stratum any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should prioritize survival and take
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,temporary refuge in the\NClearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To that end, we must protect this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transfer circle is\Nour only path forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be patient a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will overcome this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never noticed it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Director Origin seems\Nespecially popular with the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a search party set out for\Na prison located northeast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the village to see if\Nanyone had taken refuge there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas and I volunteered to go along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director, what kind of bad\Nguys were held in the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:14:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ordinary criminals are kept in jail\Ncells within the Hunter Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those who are imprisoned in\Nthat place are irredeemable scum,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like mass murderers or\Npeople who kill for pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, any word on that\Nparticular prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He refuses to change his behavior, so\Nhe's still locked up in the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An extreme pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a rather unique nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've received countless\Ncomplaints about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly does he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a criminal, per se,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was partly his idea to\Nbe imprisoned in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wanted to be imprisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That degenerate is like a cackloach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than a\Nfew monsters to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cat cloach?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that must mean cockroach here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, we still have to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cells are all completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:14:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is somebody out there? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pathetic excuse for a clergyman.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.01,0:15:09.47,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs27\pos(318,295)\fad(437,1)}Hevee
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Clergyman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needn't be so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm simply living true to my instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I adore well-worn footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it be men's or\Nwomen's, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But rest assured, I have no interest\Nin the person wearing them whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to amass such a large\Ncollection while being held in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotten noticeably colder as of late,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I was using these\Nin place of a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the monsters were causing such a fuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I went ahead and opened all the cells,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,releasing the poor prisoners\Nfrom their bondage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what those\Ncriminals are capable of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm intimately aware of their crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I employed various\Nillusions and magic To attract the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monsters when I did it I thought it\Nmight benefit the citizenry surely
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be Joking he isn't he's not\Nthe type to crack wise about this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of thing oh my if it isn't my\NDear friend Shui how long has it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been since we last talked first off\NI'm not your friend I was Wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why we hadn't seen you lately\Nand it's because you've been here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait they know each other I'm really\Nsorry about this director Origin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I love this oddball is\Na part of the Menagerie of Fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually our healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A total weirdo who happens to be\Ngood with mind altering magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.76,0:16:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One's footwear is a mirror\Nthat reveals their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and through it, I can learn everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about their past and personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to touch their history\Nand ponder the implications.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh brother, this guy really is a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I have no use for\Npristine virginal footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me shoes worn down to\Nthe soles that tell a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:17:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The smelly boots of a hunter whose ripe\Nhistory oozes from the laces itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only then can I know\Nwhat happiness truly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I get you're into them, but you\Ncan't just steal other people's footwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, theft is one of\Nthe worst sins one can commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I serve the divine, I will not\Nstray from the righteous path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes this\Nguy such a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll badger the owner\Nof whatever shoe he's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obsessing over until they\Ngive in and sell it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the privilege to peer into history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I'm happy to\Npay a fair price for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like how he\Nsometimes sounds reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah, this guy's name is Heavy, and\Nhe's as capable as he is troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Around 80% of the Menagerie of Fools'\Nbad reputation is because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy, if you're a member of the\NMenagerie of Fools, then tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the monsters attacked, why\Ndid you do nothing to try to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make it a rule not\Nto get in over my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, there's only so\Nmuch a single person can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I didn't just let everyone die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using illusions and magic that masks one's\Npresence, I managed to keep them hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save more people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this is all I could pull\Noff in the heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing! I couldn't sense anybody at\Nall. Are we safe? Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can we come out now Director Sir\NHeavy you saved all of these people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize Heavy it seems\Nthat I judged you too soon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, pay it no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, name your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve it. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those boots you're wearing\Nwould do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out she judged him\Nright the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we brought the survivors\Nback to the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were happy to be reunited\Nwith their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.95,0:19:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gratefully accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already smell the\Nsultry scent of your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can rest assured, my interest is\Ndirected solely at your footwear, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't really my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your predilections\Nare as perverse as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be nice to have a\Nhealer in the party again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't really say I'm\Nthrilled that he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about him. Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go back on my word. You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need to give this guy footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, too, but I think\Nwe're better off not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's not like this,\Nhe's a great healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree, Aka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saved our hides a couple of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the two of you have\Nalways put up with his antics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, because why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's been a while since this many\Nfrom the Menagerie of Fools were together.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.51,0:20:05.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx78\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(441,1)}The Menagerie of Fools
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of you is such a free spirit,\Nit makes it hard to lead sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with those? "You're one\Nto talk" looks on your faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy may have some personality flaws, but\Nhe's apparently a huge help in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a healer with you\Nis a pretty big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I please have some warm tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really recognize\Nany of these products,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think Lamas recommended this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.34,0:20:37.75,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HE7B195&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is something amiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell just by looking\Nthat's a boot, not a cup! I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're worried\Nthe tea might leak out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've put a cup inside to prevent spills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! No, it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:21:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, this piece was\Nworn around for 12 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its original owner was a\Nhunter whose experience
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sweat have permeated this rare gem,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I did give it a good cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you only get about a week at most\Nto enjoy the scent. Hey, take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a total pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A talking magic item, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I hear, you've got a human\Nsoul inside of you. Yes. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that fate has put you\Nin quite an unenviable position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, perhaps you should be a\Nlittle more easygoing about things.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.31,0:21:35.81,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7CA3C5&\3c&H93E4F8&\fs20}Early Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so wound up that\Nyour heart is a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for more of\Na laugh than a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you only get to live once, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well do things\Nthat bring you happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, it's hard to say why, but I\Nsense a kindred spirit within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As fellow special hobbyists,\Nwe understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll deny that with my dying beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\pos(435.2,296.8)}Respective Wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

